  "ingredients": [
    "2 large egg",
    "1 cup cheddar cheese (grated)",
    "4 slice deli-sliced black forest ham",
    "2/3 cup gruyere cheese (shredded)",
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "4 large egg",
    "1/2 cup heavy cream",
    "1/4 cup parmesan cheese",
    "1/3 cup gruyere cheese (shredded)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare the ingredients. Preheat oven to 425F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-croque-madame/#wprm-recipe-54087-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Keto-Croque-Madame-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, make the chaffles by whisking together the eggs and grated cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-croque-madame/#wprm-recipe-54087-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Keto-Croque-Madame-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a small waffle iron that is greased, make the chaffles.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-croque-madame/#wprm-recipe-54087-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Keto-Croque-Madame-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a parchment lined baking sheet, add the chaffles, topped with the deli sliced ham, and the shredded gruyere cheese. Bake in the oven for 10-15 minutes or until cheese is melted.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-croque-madame/#wprm-recipe-54087-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Keto-Croque-Madame-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the chaffles are in the oven, fry up the eggs in a frying pan with butter. Then top the baked chaffle with the fried eggs.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-croque-madame/#wprm-recipe-54087-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Keto-Croque-Madame-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan on medium heat, make the bechemel sauce by adding the heavy cream. Slowly add in the parmesan cheese and gruyere cheese a small handful at a time and wait until it is melted before adding in more.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-croque-madame/#wprm-recipe-54087-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Keto-Croque-Madame-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle the bechemel sauce on top of the chaffles, serve with a small side salad and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-croque-madame/#wprm-recipe-54087-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
